	(text "Connector: J50 ULX3S link, J51 debug header, bench test points."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 38.1 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "46d770e0-3baf-47ee-a645-98aeb80cd7a1")
	)
	(text "Design intent (Rev A, nothing here is simulated or measured)\n\nULX3S target pairs (PROPOSED; ULX3S schematics v3.1.7 p.2, Lattice FPGA-TN-02032 v1.4 p.14, p.26):\n  First choice gp/gn[8..13] (bank 7, left), second choice gp/gn[14..21] (banks 2/3, right).\n  Do not use gp/gn[0..7] or [22..27]: banks 0/1 have no differential input and no on-die termination.\n  Constrain the true pad (gp) only; gn is the complement. Do not guess polarity: swap in gateware if reversed.\nTermination rule (PROPOSED; docs/research/ulx3s-lvds-input.md s.3): terminate at the FPGA with DIFFRESISTOR=\"100\".\n  R180 (100R) is DNP and bench-only (scope or test load with no FPGA attached).\n  NEVER fit R180 with DIFFRESISTOR on: two 100R loads make ~50R and cut VOD by about half (arithmetic, not measured).\n  No series capacitors and no pull-ups on the pair (TLV3605 output is DC-coupled at ~1.2 V common mode, TLV3605 DS p.7).\n  ECP5 LVDS input common-mode range: UNRESOLVED (FPGA-DS-02012 not obtained).\nLE_HYS: R181 100k pull-up to 3V3 on this sheet only, so an unplugged header leaves the latch released (PROPOSED).\n  SHDN_N pull-up is on the slicer sheet, HOLD_N pull-up on the control sheet.\nHV rule (PROPOSED): no bare APD_BIAS pad on this sheet. HV_MON (~Vout/101, unbuffered 10 M / 100 k divider with 10 nF, source impedance ~100 k) is the ONLY HV observation point."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 38.1 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6d630b98-4018-4b1c-8714-16d383955aca")
	)
	(text "J50 ULX3S pinout (2.54 mm, 1x6)\n1  +5V      board input from ULX3S\n2  GND      return beside the pair\n3  LVDS_P   TLV3605 OUT+ (to gp)\n4  LVDS_N   TLV3605 OUT- (to gn)\n5  GND      return beside the pair\n6  HOLD_N   FPGA drives (control sheet)"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 228.6 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "195f74a7-ca9d-455d-9c21-8129d402af69")
	)
	(text "J51 DEBUG pinout (2.54 mm, 1x6)\n1  GND\n2  LOS      loss-of-signal (monitor)\n3  SHDN_N   slicer SHDN, active-low, not a guaranteed zero\n4  LE_HYS   latch/hysteresis, R181 pull-up to 3V3\n5  HOLD_N   control sheet, pull-up on control sheet\n6  HV_MON   ~Vout/101, only HV observation point"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 228.6 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "61ef47da-91cb-4841-abb5-6374dca53908")
	)
	(text "Test points TP50-TP58: 3V3, +3V7, -3V7, 5V_A, VMID, VSPAN, HV_MON, GND, GND. Hierarchical pins 3V3, +3V7, -3V7, 5V_A, HV_MON, HOLD_N are new on this sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 38.1 275 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "23e38ad8-e345-4559-abc6-791255e955fa")
	)
